<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;">errand</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> setup</span><span style="--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D;">            # do it now, and nothing else</span></span>
